WEBVTT

00:00:01.239 --> 00:00:03.319
Yeah, the Cradlewise was a lifesaver.

00:00:03.859 --> 00:00:05.279
We had no idea that

00:00:06.219 --> 00:00:07.959
literally anything like this existed.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.029
Not only does it monitor the baby for you,

00:00:10.039 --> 00:00:13.989
which is great, but it also helps
you soothe the baby back to sleep,

00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:16.339
which gives you a few extra
hours, which matters a lot.

00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:20.749
Trying it at home and renting with Whim
was literally the only way we would

00:00:20.759 --> 00:00:24.999
have been able to try it because we
weren't ready to commit to buying a

00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:26.620
Cradlewise outright.

00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:29.299
But being able to rent it with no stress,

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:31.779
knowing I could return it at
any time if it didn't work,

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.189
gave us all the flexibility we needed
to feel secure in trying out this great

00:00:36.199 --> 00:00:37.680
tool, and we're really happy with it
